(text "06  MEASUREMENT" (at 287.02 129.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.65 1.65)) (justify left)) (uuid 04131105-e67b-4084-b689-4bf972b3d1c8))
(text "J3: 1-2=5 V | 3-4=9 V | 5-6=12 V | 7-8=15 V\n9-10=20 V (open circuit / parking row). Missing shunt also requests 20 V.\nFit 1-2 by default. Change selection only with USB unplugged." (at 20.32 223.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid c0fd788c-0d21-4d9e-8adf-eb57917d6639))
(text "J4 open = output disabled (default). Shunt = enable permitted.\nNo reverse-current blocking. Do not connect a battery or another supply.\nFuse is fault protection; there is no precision output current limit." (at 152.4 223.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 87174208-6183-40c3-8665-b47d4cfca796))
(text "LEDs indicate rail presence only. Measure VOUT before connecting a load.\n12 V is source-dependent. Other selections may fall back to lower PDOs.\nNo external Rd resistors: U1 contains CC terminations." (at 20.32 246.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 5f42ede9-ad61-47d3-8d94-85f1bc4ddeb2))
(text "2 A / 40 W design target; not measured or qualified.\nD+/D-, SBU and I2C are intentionally unused.\nPCB supplied as an unrouted placement starter." (at 152.4 246.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid df3d3d0a-c160-48c7-89ea-77c00d3a0195))
